    Hi Anna and Hao,
    Is the problem with the MPI  naming for a certain debugger? 
    I am fine if we end up renaming stuff in MPI routines and/or variables. I remember that I used gd long time ago to debug the code and I don't remember that MPI names were an issue.  But anyway, you can take the steps which you see appropriate for the code.


