>
>     The plan is to use this tool to look at relative memory allocations for the different forward solvers and MPI strategies (probably not going to happen soon, though) and to search for memory leaks. You might want to address this with something else, but I suspect that you might face similar issues also with different debuggers and profilers. They all go by the standard. So might as well get this fixed, IMHO. I'm actually surprised that this hasn't been an issue in the past...
