A major update to SensMatrix. Added subroutines fwdPred_TX, Jmult_TX and JmultT_TX,
that accomplish the respective tasks for a single transmitter. The subroutines
fwdPred, Jmult and JmultT now loop over their single-transmitter versions.
This is a necessary modification to facilitate the development of parallel code.
Had to include several saved variables in the SensMatrix module, to preserve Gary's
efficiency efforts.
Be very careful with initSolver & exitSolver routines! Note that initSolver only
initializes if it feels like it (e.g. new mode etc) On the other hand, exitSolver
always deallocates everything (including some saved private variables in EMsolver).
So, it is not intended to be used after fwdSolve or sensSolve are done, at every
frequency, or even after the fwdPred computation. Instead, only use it when you
want to completely restart the solver or to deallocate all memory.

